{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.4322509765625,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "The results of the evaluation showed the variability of both human readers and CAD software",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.3969116210938,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "programmes across different settings and populations. In comparing the range of accuracy of CAD",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.3793334960938,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "to that of human readers interpreting CXRs and noting the variability of readers and the substantial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4102783203125,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "overlap between the two ranges, the data suggested there is little difference between the two.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4056396484375,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, the GDG considered that CAD software programmes can be considered accurate when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        214.27088928222656,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "compared with human readers.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.42333984375,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation applies to software brands that upon external validation demonstrate a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4356689453125,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "performance that is not inferior to the products reviewed by the GDG in 2020. The analysis for this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4277954101562,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "recommendation was restricted to bacteriologically confirmed TB and, thus, the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.43115234375,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "may not necessarily apply to other forms of TB (such as exclusively extrapulmonary TB or clinically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        142.0911102294922,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed TB).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4156494140625,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is specific to adults and adolescents aged 15 years and older but applies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4234008789062,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "regardless of HIV status. Limited data were available for comparing CAD to human interpretation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.446533203125,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "of CXR among people living with HIV; further evidence is needed about the performance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4232177734375,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "CAD software among people living with HIV, to enable better setting-specific and patient-specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        201.6583251953125,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "calibration of CAD software.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.2064208984375,
        478.9331970214844,
        353.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6: Screening for TB using molecular WHO-recommended rapid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.2064208984375,
        151.84811401367188,
        367.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic tests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4025268554688,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review of the performance of an mWRD used to screen for TB among people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4013061523438,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with HIV included 14 studies with a total of 9209 participants. The Xpert MTB/RIF assay was the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3815307617188,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "primary mWRD used in these studies. The prevalence of TB in the studies ranged from 1% to 26%.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4002685546875,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The average TB prevalence among participants attending outpatient facilities was 8.6%. Using an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.415771484375,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "mWRD alone was found to have sensitivity of 0.69 (95% CI: 0.60–0.76) and specificity of 0.98 (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.3795166015625,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "CI: 0.97–0.99) compared with using the W4SS followed by an mWRD as a diagnostic test, which had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.421142578125,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity of 0.62 (95% CI: 0.56–0.69) and specificity of 0.99 (95% CI: 0.97–0.99) (see Table 2.5). There",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.41357421875,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "were no significant differences in the accuracy of the mWRD between the different subpopulations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        352.7235412597656,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "when compared with using the W4SS followed by the mWRD.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.3814697265625,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Due to the increased sensitivity of mWRDs, but also in consideration of the likely challenges relating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.41015625,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to access, high costs and feasibility in many countries, mWRDs are recommended conditionally as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.3871459960938,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "an option for screening for TB disease among all adults and adolescents living with HIV, who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.3836669921875,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "not medical inpatients in settings where the TB prevalence exceeds 10% (for whom there is a strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.415771484375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, see below). As with all screening tools, the GDG emphasized the importance in all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4420166015625,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "settings of following up an mWRD screen with a diagnostic assessment (see Section 2.2) to prevent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4179077148438,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the potential harm of overtreatment. In addition, due consideration should be made to prioritizing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4213256835938,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "mWRDs as a diagnostic test for all people with presumptive TB before scaling up mWRD as a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        136.53720092773438,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "screening test.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "12",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        364.234375,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
